<tab><cl=F0F010>THE TABLETS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>The lock is controlled by means of the tablet. By clicking on the <cl=FFFFFF>Clan button<cl=B0B0B0>, you can see the name of the clan that owns the castle. The <cl=FFFFFF>Possession button will<cl=B0B0B0> show a list of characters currently in the castle's possession. With the help of the <cl=FFFFFF>Fee, you<cl=B0B0B0> can set the amount of the fee that will need to be paid to characters who do not belong to the clan that captured the castle for being on the territory of the castle.<br>

<br>To increase the defensive power of the castle, you need to pay the following taxes:<br>
<cl=FFFFFF><br>
Land tax<br>
Gate Tax<br>
Tax on the tablet<br>
Dungeon Tax<br>
}